[al:新概念英语第一册]
[ti:Terrible Toothache]
[00:00.66]Lesson 77 | 第77课
[00:02.74]Terrible toothache | 严重的牙痛
[00:05.78]Listen to the tape then answer this question. | 听录音带，然后回答这个问题。
[00:11.60]What time of day is it, do you think? How do you know? | 你认为现在是几点？你是怎么知道的？
[00:19.95]Good morning, Mr. Croft. | 早上好，克罗夫特先生。
[00:24.71]Good morning, nurse. | 早上好，护士。
[00:27.41]I want to see the dentist, please. | 我想看牙医。
[00:30.93]Do you have an appointment? | 你预约了吗？
[00:34.14]No, I don't. | 没有。
[00:36.47]Is it urgent? | 情况紧急吗？
[00:38.69]Yes, it is. | 是的，很紧急。
[00:41.00]It's very urgent. | 非常紧急。
[00:43.89]I feel awful. | 我感觉糟透了。
[00:46.54]I have a terrible toothache. | 我牙痛得厉害。
[00:49.94]Can you come at 10 a.m. on Monday, April 24th? | 你能在4月24日星期一上午10点来吗？
[00:56.97]I must see the dentist now, nurse. | 护士，我必须现在就看牙医。
[01:02.48]The dentist is very busy at the moment. | 牙医现在很忙。
[01:07.27]Can you come at 2 p.m. ? | 你能在下午2点来吗？
[01:10.62]That's very late. | 那太晚了。
[01:14.01]Can the dentist see me now? | 牙医现在能给我看病吗？
[01:17.20]I'm afraid that he can't, Mr. Croft. | 克罗夫特先生，恐怕他不能。
[01:21.81]Can't you wait till this afternoon? | 你不能等到今天下午吗？
[01:26.06]I can wait, but my toothache can't! | 我能等，但我的牙痛不能等！